3. Node CPU Usage
100 -
(
  avg by (node) (
    rate(
      node_cpu_seconds_total{
        cluster="application-eks",
        mode="idle"
      }[5m]
    )
  ) * 100
)

⚠️ In your current Alloy config, you're scraping kubelet and cAdvisor, but not node-exporter directly. So node_cpu_seconds_total may not exist.

For your current setup, use cAdvisor:

sum by (node) (
  rate(
    container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{
      cluster="application-eks",
      container!="",
      image!=""
    }[5m]
  )
)
